---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="Seichi Atlas privacy policy: what we collect, and what we don't.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="micro">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="display-lg" style="margin:.7rem 0 1rem;">Privacy, plainly</h1>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Anonymous usage analytics via Google Analytics 4 (GA4). It tracks page views and
            interactions in aggregate; it does not let us identify you personally.</li>
        <li>No accounts, no login, and no personal data is collected while you browse.</li>
        <li>If you email us, we keep your message only to answer it.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        GA4 uses its own cookies (such as <code class="mono">_ga</code> and
        <code class="mono">_ga_*</code>) to distinguish visitors. It is set to anonymous
        IP handling and does not store identifying details. A theme preference may be kept in
        your browser's local storage so the site remembers your light/dark choice.
      </p>

      <h2>Route waitlist</h2>
      <p>
        The route-export waitlist collects your email address for the sole purpose of notifying you
        when export launches. It is never sold or shared. You can ask to be removed at any time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 68ch; }
  .prose h2 { margin: 2.4rem 0 0.8rem; font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .prose p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose ul { margin: 0 0 1.4rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .prose li::marker { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
